; The standalone sift.mongo ppx — the query DSL ([%q]/[%fields]/[%sort]/[%set]/[%index]) plus the
; [@@deriving sift] codec deriver. For non-fur libraries that use the sift.mongo toolkit. Libraries on
; (pps fennec.fur.ppx) get all of it for free, so they don't list this.
